# rule is the whole file: per-directory rules would name the same two people and
# only add places to forget when one of them changes.
#
# MAINTAINERS.md says which changes need BOTH approvals rather than one. GitHub
# cannot express that, so it stays a rule we keep, not one that is enforced.
